    {
      "id": "overview",
      "text": "This countdown crosses the whole planet: from the forests of Madagascar to the desert of Turkmenistan, from the canals of Mexico City to the Arctic islands of Norway, and all the way to Australia. Ten countries. Ten things you will not find anywhere else. Let's count down.",
