          [
            "1968",
            "Tiffany & Co. names it tanzanite"
          ],
          [
            "2002",
            "Becomes a December birthstone"
          ],
          [
            "Today",
            "Still mined only here"
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seedvault",
      "text": "Number nine is a vault for the end of the world. Fly north from Oslo, past Tromsø, to the Arctic island of Spitsbergen. Outside the town of Longyearbyen, a tunnel runs deep into a frozen mountain. Inside is the Svalbard Global Seed Vault, the world's largest backup of the crops that feed us.",
