      "id": "seedvault-world",
      "text": "Gene banks around the world send copies here: rice from the Philippines, maize and wheat from Mexico, beans from Colombia, and crops from India and Nigeria. Today it holds about one point four million seed samples, kept at minus eighteen degrees, with room for four and a half million.",
