    {
      "id": "axolotl-powers",
      "text": "Lose a leg? An axolotl grows it back, with no scar. It can even repair its spinal cord and parts of its heart and brain, and it keeps its baby features all its life. But in the wild it is critically endangered: about six thousand per square kilometre in nineteen ninety-eight, just thirty-six in twenty fourteen.",
