    {
      "id": "calendar",
      "text": "Number seven isn't something you can touch. It's time itself. In Ethiopia, from Addis Ababa to Lalibela, Gondar and Aksum, it isn't twenty twenty-six right now. It's the year twenty nineteen. Ethiopia runs on its own calendar, and it's the country's official one.",
