    {
      "id": "hummingbird",
      "text": "Number five weighs less than a coin. In the Zapata Swamp, southeast of Havana, and on the Isle of Youth lives the bee hummingbird, the smallest bird in the world. Look anywhere else on the planet, and you won't find one. It lives only in Cuba.",
