    {
      "id": "darvaza",
      "text": "Number four is nicknamed the Gates of Hell. In Turkmenistan, in the middle of the Karakum Desert, about two hundred and sixty kilometres north of the capital, Ashgabat, there's a hole in the ground that has been on fire for decades. Its real name is the Darvaza gas crater.",
