      "id": "lemurs",
      "text": "Number three. Madagascar broke away from the other continents tens of millions of years ago, and life here went its own way. In the rainforests of Andasibe and Ranomafana, in the dry west near Morondava, and even close to the capital, Antananarivo, you'll meet lemurs.",
