    {
      "id": "lemurs-count",
      "text": "Wild lemurs live naturally only here, apart from a few on the nearby Comoros islands. There are one hundred and seven species, from tiny mouse lemurs to the singing indri. But in twenty twenty, experts found that one hundred and three of them are threatened, and thirty-three are critically endangered.",
