    {
      "id": "komodo-park",
      "text": "Adults can grow up to three metres long and usually weigh around seventy kilograms. They hunt deer and wild pigs, and their bite carries venom. Komodo, Rinca and Padar form a national park, a UNESCO World Heritage Site since nineteen ninety-one, reached by boat from Labuan Bajo. Only about fourteen hundred adult dragons remain.",
